<title>POLAND: Mostostal-E in PLN 17.7 mln German deal.</title>
<headline>Mostostal-E in PLN 17.7 mln German deal.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish construction and trading company Mostostal Export SA said it had signed a 17.7-million- zloty deal on building a shopping centre for Germany's trader firm Raab Karcher, a subsidiary of Veba AG.</p>
<p>Mostostal said the works would be carried out by February 1998.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
